    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "luminosity.",
    "start": 2258.16,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And what can I claim to be?",
    "start": 2262.64,
    "duration": 8.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Not much.",
    "start": 2266.88,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Welcome to the desert of the real.",
    "start": 2272.079,
    "duration": 7.601
  },
  {
    "text": "as Lawrence Fishburn in the Matrix.",
    "start": 2275.839,
    "duration": 6.481
  },
  {
    "text": "I don't know. I don't really remember",
    "start": 2279.68,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "that, but I always love that line. And",
    "start": 2282.32,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe that line that sounds kind of um",
    "start": 2284.4,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "Lanian, you know, Jacan,",
    "start": 2288.16,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "I don't know. But uh the desert of the",
    "start": 2291.599,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "real,",
    "start": 2295.359,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "barren,",
    "start": 2297.52,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "desolate. Normally those words have very",
    "start": 2300.24,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "bad connotations.",
    "start": 2302.72,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "But now",
    "start": 2305.839,
    "duration": 5.721
  },
  {
    "text": "it's relief.",
    "start": 2308.079,
    "duration": 3.481
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 2311.599,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "all of some sorrow",
    "start": 2313.28,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "seems like melodrama.",
    "start": 2316.48,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "All of it.",
    "start": 2321.599,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "And birth and death and hope and fear.",
    "start": 2326.0,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "All of it.",
    "start": 2329.68,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "But the story doesn't end there",
    "start": 2335.92,
    "duration": 4.439
  },
  {
    "text": "from this kind of rich pregnant",
    "start": 2340.4,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "baronness new",
    "start": 2344.16,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "species of love become possible.",
    "start": 2347.04,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "One uh yogi said um my being was",
    "start": 2352.64,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "pixelated and dissolved into the rest of",
    "start": 2357.44,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "the pixels",
    "start": 2360.48,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "that made up the entirety of everything",
    "start": 2362.32,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "else.",
    "start": 2364.56,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And this emptiness cannot be the ground",
    "start": 2369.04,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "for hate or clinging, but it can be the",
    "start": 2371.599,
    "duration": 7.48
  },
  {
    "text": "ground for love,",
    "start": 2375.52,
    "duration": 3.559
  },
  {
    "text": "you know.",
    "start": 2381.44,
    "duration": 2.56
  },
  {
    "text": "You you are not your face.",
    "start": 2384.16,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Face is like so personal and intimate.",
    "start": 2388.32,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "It somehow",
    "start": 2393.28,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "it's confused for self",
    "start": 2395.68,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "rather than a part of our body.",
    "start": 2398.8,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "So yeah, we say you're not your face,",
    "start": 2403.28,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "but when you",
    "start": 2405.52,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "know this, the image of your face and",
    "start": 2408.079,
    "duration": 6.321
  },
  {
    "text": "all faces",
    "start": 2412.0,
    "duration": 7.079
  },
  {
    "text": "will break your heart wide open.",
    "start": 2414.4,
    "duration": 4.679
  },
  {
    "text": "And this is a very uncompulsive",
    "start": 2420.0,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "form of love.",
    "start": 2424.8,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, sometimes it's like we're",
    "start": 2427.2,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "looking for opportunities, channels to",
    "start": 2428.72,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "pour our love into. This is uh not that",
    "start": 2432.32,
    "duration": 5.759
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of love.",
    "start": 2436.0,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "But when",
    "start": 2438.079,
    "duration": 6.721
  },
  {
    "text": "love is called for, it arises with so",
    "start": 2441.04,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "much potency",
    "start": 2444.8,
    "duration": 4.559
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2447.2,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "unselfcreated,",
    "start": 2449.359,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "unmanufactured",
    "start": 2452.0,
    "duration": 5.079
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of feeling.",
    "start": 2453.599,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "and the pain of others um",
    "start": 2457.52,
    "duration": 8.68
  },
  {
    "text": "breaks the heart open.",
    "start": 2462.4,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Their confusion",
    "start": 2466.319,
    "duration": 5.081
  },
  {
    "text": "and clinging",
    "start": 2468.24,
    "duration": 3.16
  },
  {
    "text": "and the the drama and pain of selfing",
    "start": 2473.44,
    "duration": 10.8
  },
  {
    "text": "the egoic catastrophe. It's all very",
    "start": 2480.48,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "dear.",
    "start": 2484.24,
    "duration": 2.8
  },
  {
    "text": "This is not arrogance that we see",
    "start": 2489.76,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "ourselves in others. See others",
    "start": 2492.24,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "in yourself.",
    "start": 2496.48,
    "duration": 9.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And the love feels um very um",
    "start": 2499.839,
    "duration": 5.641
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah very beautiful and",
    "start": 2506.8,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "very ordinary.",
    "start": 2510.64,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "And you know um",
    "start": 2515.92,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "it's kind of like okay there's something",
    "start": 2520.56,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "that ends the some of the seeking ends.",
    "start": 2522.319,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "It's like okay I'm not going to",
    "start": 2526.96,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "look for a peace or a love more sublime",
    "start": 2530.24,
    "duration": 9.359
  },
  {
    "text": "than this. This is this is like",
    "start": 2534.0,
    "duration": 9.44
  },
  {
    "text": "as much as the circuits",
    "start": 2539.599,
    "duration": 7.48
  },
  {
    "text": "could ask for.",
    "start": 2543.44,
    "duration": 3.639
  },
  {
    "text": "And so there's there's a an integration",
    "start": 2547.76,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "and it could say a lot more about it.",
    "start": 2550.4,
    "duration": 9.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Wisdom of nothing, everything.",
    "start": 2554.0,
    "duration": 5.64
  },
  {
    "text": "close with um",
    "start": 2562.079,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "something from uh from Shinzen Young",
    "start": 2565.04,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "says, \"The true goal of meditation is",
    "start": 2568.64,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "achieved through a dialectical process",
    "start": 2570.56,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "that alternates between dissolving into",
    "start": 2573.44,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "flowing nothingness",
    "start": 2576.4,
    "duration": 4.959
  },
  {
    "text": "and detecting subtler and subtler",
    "start": 2579.04,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "instances of solidified somethingness.",
    "start": 2581.359,
    "duration": 7.521
  },
  {
    "text": "We must watch how an ordinary experience",
    "start": 2586.56,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "becomes waves of impermanence over and",
    "start": 2588.88,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "over",
    "start": 2592.0,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "before we will really believe that every",
    "start": 2593.76,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "ordinary experience is by nature",
    "start": 2595.92,
    "duration": 4.159
  },
  {
    "text": "extraordinary.",
    "start": 2597.76,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We must do this with tremendous",
    "start": 2600.079,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "patience, equinimity and openness.",
    "start": 2601.76,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Eventually it sinks in.",
    "start": 2605.599,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "Ultimately",
    "start": 2608.48,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "we come to realize that in in essence",
    "start": 2610.16,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "there is no sensory experience at all.",
    "start": 2613.52,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "There's only vibrating vacuity.",
    "start": 2616.88,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "When experience flows unimpeded, the",
    "start": 2621.04,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "oneness of spirit arises.",
    "start": 2623.359,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "When experience gets blocked or",
    "start": 2627.04,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "congealed, the multiplicity of matter",
    "start": 2628.96,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "arises.",
    "start": 2632.0,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And there is absolutely nothing wrong",
    "start": 2634.24,
    "duration": 4.879
  },
  {
    "text": "with the world of multiplicity and",
    "start": 2636.72,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "materiality",
    "start": 2639.119,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "as long as it is not the only world",
    "start": 2641.839,
    "duration": 7.681
  },
  {
    "text": "you're familiar with.",
    "start": 2645.92,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "As you go about the ordinary exper",
    "start": 2649.52,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "activities during the day, emptiness and",
    "start": 2651.76,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "form shade into and out of each other",
    "start": 2654.64,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "smoothly and continuously",
    "start": 2658.56,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "even in the most complex, intense or",
    "start": 2662.16,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "mundane situations.",
    "start": 2665.76,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Your connection to the source is never",
    "start": 2668.4,
    "duration": 7.8
  },
  {
    "text": "completely severed.",
    "start": 2672.56,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "offer that for your consideration.",
    "start": 2679.68,
    "duration": 7.48
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh",
    "start": 2683.68,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah, I wish you uh wish you a good uh",
    "start": 2687.68,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "good week. Good to be together.",
    "start": 2690.48,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "So, I'll I'll um chat in",
    "start": 2706.56,
    "duration": 7.759
  },
  {
    "text": "a uh maybe maybe I'll take questions",
    "start": 2710.96,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "next time. Uh",
    "start": 2714.319,
    "duration": 6.961
  },
  {
    "text": "so, I chatted in a uh",
    "start": 2718.0,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "a link there to submit anonymous",
    "start": 2721.28,
    "duration": 4.319
  },
  {
    "text": "questions",
    "start": 2723.68,
    "duration": 4.639
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh",
    "start": 2725.599,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "you can also submit hate mail there,",
    "start": 2728.319,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "you know.",
    "start": 2731.599,
    "duration": 6.281
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh",
    "start": 2734.24,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah, anything actually",
    "start": 2740.16,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "um just uh useful to uh to hear what's",
    "start": 2743.119,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "on your mind.",
    "start": 2746.0,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay. Um you all uh you all be well.",
    "start": 2748.079,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "Have a good uh good week and uh see you",
    "start": 2752.0,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "uh see you next time.",
    "start": 2756.0,
    "duration": 3.72
  }
]